<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The month, compact: where the widget starts. Single-letter days and
     smaller circles, so the whole month fits in three cells by two.
     Marked day by day the way the Calendar tab marks it. Six rows of seven
     are laid out; the provider hides the sixth (and in a February that
     starts on a Monday, the fifth) when the month does not reach it. -->
